      "instance_name": "child",
      "label": "child in wheelchair",
      "description": "A young child with light brown hair, wearing a white t-shirt and dark shorts, seated in a red manual wheelchair. The child is looking slightly to the side with a neutral or faintly smiling expression. The child appears to be of able-bodied appearance but is using a wheelchair, suggesting a physical disability or mobility aid. The child is the central focus of the image.",
