      "label": "child in wheelchair on beach",
      "description": "A young child in a red manual wheelchair is positioned in the foreground on a sandy beach, with the ocean and distant mountains in the background. The child is the central focus, looking slightly to the side. The scene is set outdoors during daylight, with blurred figures of other beachgoers in the background, suggesting a public recreational setting.",
